spes-0173: battery level, voltage, current, temperature and charger state, read only

QUP0 SE1 as a read-only bus (spes_i2c1_up/spes_i2c1_read in spes_amp.c, one lock with the
amplifier bring-up) and SweetBattery reading the max77729 gauge (0x36) and charger (0x69)
of board 0x20022, or the SM5602 (0x71) and bq2589x (0x6a) of board 0x40022, whichever gauge
answers. Only with boot-arg spesbattery=1. Nothing is written to any chip.
NOT RUN ON HARDWARE YET.
